# Synthetic DyberPet fixtures (D-13b, docs/41 §5.2) are constructor GENERATED artifacts.
# They are intentionally NOT tracked in git:
#   * D-13a forbids committing any ecosystem material; and
#   * A4 (docs/52 §6 R-02) must see zero tracked DyberPet material paths.
# The real 49.85 MB DyberPet package lives under assets/user/ (gitignored) and is NEVER copied in.
# Regenerate from source of truth:
#   node tools/gen-dyberpet-fixture.mjs --out tests/fixtures/dyberpet-min
# The pattern is deliberately wide: D-13c drills move / rename / regenerate these trees
# (dyberpet-min-moved/, dyberpet-idempotent1/, ...) and a plain `git add tests/` must never
# pick one up. Every DyberPet fixture under this directory is generated, never authored.
dyberpet-*/
